index 0000000..ee7dfc4
--- /dev/null
+++ b/parser-verification-s7pa6g2d/head/requirements.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Settings contain KEY=VALUE lines. Split at the first equals only; later equals signs belong to the value. Strip surrounding key/value whitespace, ignore blank/comment lines, retain empty values, last duplicate key wins. Inputs have nonempty keys and an equals sign on each non-comment/nonblank line. Quoting, interpolation and malformed input policy are outside scope. Current checks and samples must be identical for both implementations. The working parser fix is not committed.
